{"t":"HST","n":"Host Hotels & Resorts, Inc.","ex":"NasdaqGS","cur":"USD","px":24.73,"chg":0.64,"chgPct":0.02635,"prev":24.1,"dayH":24.98,"dayL":24.48,"w52H":26.19,"w52L":17.04,"vol":6102714,"avgVol":7290960,"mcap":17179788288,"pe":18.32,"fpe":21.73,"eps":1.35,"feps":1.14,"pb":2.67,"div":0.8,"divY":0.0323,"beta":1.11,"short":39572688,"shortPct":0.081,"shortRatio":4.78,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Real Estate","sKo":"부동산","i":"REIT - Hotel & Motel","iKo":"REIT - 호텔앤모텔","city":"Bethesda","emp":162,"web":"https://www.hosthotels.com","sum":"Host Hotels & Resorts, Inc. is an S&P 500 company and is the largest lodging real estate investment trust and one of the largest owners of luxury and upper-upscale hotels. The Company currently owns 70 properties in the United States and five properties internationally totaling approximately 41,300 rooms. The Company also holds non-controlling interests in seven domestic joint ventures. Guided by a disciplined approach to capital allocation and aggressive asset management, the Company partners with premium brands such as Marriott, Ritz-Carlton, Westin, W, The Luxury Collection, Hyatt, Fairmont, 1 Hotels, Hilton, Swissôtel, ibis and Novotel, as well as independent brands. Host Hotels & Resorts, Inc. was established in 1927 and was incorporated in Maryland.","sumKo":"Host Hotels & Resorts, Inc.는 S&P 500 기업이자 최대 숙박 부동산 투자 신탁이자 럭셔리 및 고급 호텔의 최대 소유주 중 하나입니다. 회사는 현재 미국에서 70개 부동산, 국제적으로 5개 부동산, 총 약 41,300개의 객실을 소유하고 있습니다. 또한 회사는 7개의 국내 합작투자회사에 대한 비지배지분을 보유하고 있습니다. 자본 배분에 대한 엄격한 접근 방식과 공격적인 자산 관리에 따라 회사는 Marriott, Ritz-Carlton, Westin, W, The Luxury Collection, Hyatt, Fairmont, 1 Hotels, Hilton, Swissôtel, ibis 및 Novotel과 같은 프리미엄 브랜드는 물론 독립 브랜드와도 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. Host Hotels & Resorts, Inc.는 1927년에 설립되어 메릴랜드에 법인화되었습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":4907000000,"ni":633000000},{"y":2023,"rev":5311000000,"ni":740000000},{"y":2024,"rev":5684000000,"ni":697000000},{"y":2025,"rev":6114000000,"ni":765000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q20